{"title":"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The students in Mrs. Sawyer's class were asked to do a taste test of five kinds of candy. Each student chose one kind of candy. A bar graph of their preferences is shown. What percent of her class chose candy E?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/c/b8c9bfef9339a2c3cb17bb5eacdfa7d91c09cf4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] real[] r={6, 8, 4, 2, 5}; int i; for(i=0; i&lt;5; i=i+1) { filldraw((4i,0)--(4i+3,0)--(4i+3,2r[i])--(4i,2r[i])--cycle, black, black); } draw(origin--(19,0)--(19,16)--(0,16)--cycle, linewidth(0.9)); for(i=1; i&lt;8; i=i+1) { draw((0,2i)--(19,2i)); } label(&quot;$0$&quot;, (0,2*0), W); label(&quot;$1$&quot;, (0,2*1), W); label(&quot;$2$&quot;, (0,2*2), W); label(&quot;$3$&quot;, (0,2*3), W); label(&quot;$4$&quot;, (0,2*4), W); label(&quot;$5$&quot;, (0,2*5), W); label(&quot;$6$&quot;, (0,2*6), W); label(&quot;$7$&quot;, (0,2*7), W); label(&quot;$8$&quot;, (0,2*8), W); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, (0*4+1.5, 0), S); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, (1*4+1.5, 0), S); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, (2*4+1.5, 0), S); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, (3*4+1.5, 0), S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, (4*4+1.5, 0), S); label(&quot;SWEET TOOTH&quot;, (9.5,18), N); label(&quot;Kinds of candy&quot;, (9.5,-2), S); label(rotate(90)*&quot;Number of students&quot;, (-2,8), W);[/asy]\" width=\"235\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/0/1e01d1e78000676892d5ebbe188a469ea4fd23b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>According to the graph, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> students out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cf8a7a68141f4953e4fa61437ec53bf7613cf65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+8+4+2+5=25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"176\" height=\"14\" /> total chose candy E. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/f/91f79bdda8a202595e1197dc1b8525169b38a898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{25} = 0.2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 20} \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"173\" height=\"38\" /> chose candy E.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/A7uh_ZTDegE\">https://youtu.be/A7uh_ZTDegE</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 8\">2002 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti